<#64b4ff>AQUA MIST</>
Data Collect (hold)		^X
  Her computer scan. +1 mist level every 3/4 second held,
  up to 3. Let go of X to stop.
  Mist also rises when her projectiles hit: Shabon Spray,
  Shine Aqua Illusion, the EX barrier and Freezing.
  Lv 1: +10% damage and an extra air jump.
  Lv 2: +15% damage, some moves make illusions.
  Lv 3: +20% damage, 10% less damage taken, lasts longer.
  She fades into the mist if she stands still.
Planet Power (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  3 seconds: faster, free chains, chip damage, supers
  cost less. No guarding or meter gain.

<#64b4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash / Back Dash (air too)		_F_F / _B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#64b4ff>NORMALS</>
Light Punch / Heavy Punch / Heavy Kick		^A / ^B / ^C
  Tap Light again for her auto combo.
Light Kick		_F^A
Crouching Light Kick		_DF^A
Crouching Light / Heavy Punch		_D^A / _D^B
Crouching Heavy Kick		_D^C
Air Light / Heavy / Kick		^A / ^B / ^C
Jumpdown Attack (air)		_D^A
Cross-up Attack (air)		_D^B / _D^C

<#64b4ff>SPECIALS</>
Shabon Spray (charge)		_B_F^A / ^B
Shabon Spray Barrier (EX)		_B_F^C
Aqua Ribbon Upper (charge)		_D_U^A / ^B
Triple Aqua Ribbon Upper (EX)		_D_U^C
Shine Aqua Illusion		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Aqua Mirage (air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Reverse Break Step		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Water Bullet (EX)		_D_DF_F^C
  Charge moves: hold the first direction a moment.
  EX moves cost 500 meter.

<#64b4ff>SUPERS</>
Shabon Spray Freezing (2 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Shine Aqua Cutter (2 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Planet Power makes them cost 1.5 bars.
